{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾經創造跨大西洋航行速度紀錄的美國遠洋客輪「美國號」（SS United States），在服役74年後迎來了最終歸宿。2026年11月11日，這艘曾經代表美國造船工業巔峯的巨型客輪在佛羅裏達州西北部海域被有控制地沉入海底，正式轉變為全球最大的人工魚礁之一，也標誌着一段遠洋客輪黃金時代的歷史徹底落幕。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586034.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.610248+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.147077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.147077+00:00","content_hash":"2cf9dde4334db75f39e54619560e02a204eb89fad40d12202f3ad10be401ba08","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}